  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:350px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-Red pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Solar-Heat Conversion</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/4/4f/Superman_Heat_Vision.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20170501135306\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Superman Heat Vision\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/4/4f/Superman_Heat_Vision.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/333?cb=20170501135306\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/4/4f/Superman_Heat_Vision.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/333?cb=20170501135306 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/4/4f/Superman_Heat_Vision.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20170501135306 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Superman Heat Vision\" width=\"270\" height=\"405\" data-image-key=\"Superman_Heat_Vision.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Superman Heat Vision.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Superman (DC Comics) can absorb solar radiation/energy and convert it into heat vision.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Absorb solar energy and convert it into energized heat.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The power to <b>absorb solar energy and convert it into energized heat</b>. Combination of <a href=\"/wiki/Energetic_Heating\" title=\"Energetic Heating\">Energetic Heating</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Solar_Conversion\" title=\"Solar Conversion\">Solar Conversion</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Conversion\" title=\"Energy Conversion\">Energy Conversion</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Videos\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Videos</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FSolar-Heat_Conversion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can absorb solar energy and convert it into beams/blasts of energized heat.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FSolar-Heat_Conversion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Energized_Body\" title=\"Energized Body\">Energized Body</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Heat_Generation\" title=\"Heat Generation\">Heat Generation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Heat_Vision\" title=\"Heat Vision\">Heat Vision</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Face_Blasts\" title=\"Face Blasts\">Face Blasts</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ballistic_Heat_Vision\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ballistic Heat Vision\">Ballistic Heat Vision</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Ballistic_Face_Blasts\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ballistic Face Blasts\">Ballistic Face Blasts</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Solar_Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Solar Energy Absorption\">Solar Energy Absorption</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Solar_Capacitor\" title=\"Solar Capacitor\">Solar Capacitor</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Solar_Energizing\" title=\"Solar Energizing\">Solar Energizing</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FSolar-Heat_Conversion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Alien_Physiology\" title=\"Alien Physiology\">Alien Physiology</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Ambient_Energy_Conversion\" title=\"Ambient Energy Conversion\">Ambient Energy Conversion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Heat_Conversion\" title=\"Heat Conversion\">Heat Conversion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Solar_Manipulation\" title=\"Solar Manipulation\">Solar Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Solar_Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Solar Energy Manipulation\">Solar Energy Manipulation</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FSolar-Heat_Conversion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"fal